      "description": "Collapsed expandable project card; the whole header is a button.",
      "html": "<article class=\"ds-card\"><button class=\"ds-card-head\"><span class=\"ds-idx\">01</span><span class=\"ds-toggle\"></span><h3>Government Workflows</h3><p>Auditable AI finance workflows built for West Covina’s finance department.</p></button></article>",
      "css": ".ds-card{position:relative;max-width:300px;border:1px solid rgba(236,234,226,0.1);border-radius:3px;padding:26px;background:#0a1210 linear-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,0.012),rgba(255,255,255,0.012));color:#eceae2;font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',ui-monospace,monospace;transition:border-color .25s ease;}.ds-card:hover{border-color:rgba(154,211,176,0.4);}.ds-card-head{display:block;width:100%;padding:0;border:0;background:none;color:inherit;font:inherit;text-align:left;cursor:pointer;position:relative;}.ds-card-head:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #bad6ae;outline-offset:6px;}.ds-idx{color:#91af98;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.2em;}.ds-card h3{font-family:Newsreader,Georgia,serif;font-weight:400;font-size:1.35rem;margin:14px 0 10px;}.ds-card p{color:#a4afa6;font-size:.9rem;line-height:1.7;margin:0;}.ds-toggle{position:absolute;top:2px;right:0;width:18px;height:18px;}.ds-toggle::before,.ds-toggle::after{content:'';position:absolute;left:50%;top:50%;width:13px;height:1.5px;background:#91af98;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);transition:transform .35s cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.2,1);}.ds-toggle::after{transform:translate(-50%,-50%) rotate(90deg);}"
    },
